❗️The Armed Forces of the Russian Federation continue to launch group strikes against Ukrainian logistics facilities and vessels, used in the interests of the Armed Forces of Ukraine.

💥During the day, air-based high-precision weapons and attack drones hit the following targets:

▪️the Eridon logistics centre in Vishnevoye of Kiev region, used for storage and distribution of military cargo;

▪️the FM Logistik Dnepr logistics centre near Dudarkov of Kiev region, where warehouses were used to store dual-purpose goods as well as components of unmanned aerial vehicles;

▪️the logistics centre in Korchevatoye of Kiev region, where cargo for the Armed Forces of Ukraine was stored and distributed;

▪️a dry cargo ship with military equipment for the AFU in the port of Chernomorsk;

▪️a dry cargo with weapons and ammunition in the Black Sea waters;

▪️depots with military hardware in the port of Odessa.

🔹 Russian Defence Ministry
